  \oobeSettingsMultiPage\TelemetryVoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=FA-IR: Next, choose whether or not you want to help Microsoft diagnose and fix issues.
  \oobeSettingsMultiPage\TailoredVoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=FA-IR: If you want tips, offers, and suggestions that are tailored to you, just select Accept.
  \oobeSettingsMultiPage\SettingsTitle:
    Candidate Language=FA-IR: انتخاب تنظیمات حریم خصوصی برای دستگاه شما
  \oobeSettingsMultiPage\NextButtonText:
